// cave's soundtrack on zoo: a surprise, then the mood pair a cool item's pickup sends
// after it (Player::StartCoolItem: success, falling back to the current mood, which is
// still surprise). developer 1 prints the music system's mood changes and songs.
probe:
waitforplayer
wait 2
soundtrack music/cave.mus
forcemusic normal normal
wait 4
forcemusic surprise normal
wait 10
forcemusic success surprise
wait 25
stuffcmd "pendingevents"
end
